@baseUrl = http://localhost:8081

### Liste lesen (200)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/courses
X-Correlation-ID: manual-list

### Einzelnen Datensatz lesen (200)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/courses/1

### Gültigen Datensatz anlegen (201)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/courses
Content-Type: application/json
X-Correlation-ID: manual-create

{
  "courseCode": "C-999",
  "title": "Mobility Lab",
  "level": "BEGINNER",
  "durationMinutes": 45,
  "roomId": 1
}

### Ungültigen Datensatz ablehnen (400)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/courses
Content-Type: application/json
X-Correlation-ID: manual-validation

{}

### Vorhandenen fachlichen Schlüssel ablehnen (409)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/courses
Content-Type: application/json
X-Correlation-ID: manual-conflict

{
  "courseCode": "C-101",
  "title": "Mobility Lab",
  "level": "BEGINNER",
  "durationMinutes": 45,
  "roomId": 1
}

### Seed-Datensatz mit unverändertem Schlüssel ersetzen (200)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/courses/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "courseCode": "C-101",
  "title": "Mobility Lab aktualisiert",
  "level": "BEGINNER",
  "durationMinutes": 45,
  "roomId": 1
}

### Unbekannten Datensatz idempotent löschen (204)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/courses/999999
